@doc """
Renders a styled breadcrumb trail.

Generated by `mix flint.add breadcrumbs`. Theming lives in `flint.css`; the
wrapper adds the `data-breadcrumbs` marker the theme targets and forwards
`label` and the remaining headless attributes. Headless structure and the
navigation landmark come from `FlintUI.breadcrumbs`; use
`FlintUI.breadcrumbs_item` for each crumb.
"""
<%= @attrs %>
<%= @slots %>

def <%= @name %>(assigns) do
  ~H"""
  <FlintUI.breadcrumbs data-breadcrumbs class={@class} {@rest}>
    {render_slot(@inner_block)}
  </FlintUI.breadcrumbs>
  """
end
